<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30628" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nĕc-ŏpīnus</span></b>  (also
		separately, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nĕc
			ŏpīnus</span></b> ), a, um,
		adj. (poet). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Pass., unexpected</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">necopina mors,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					1, 224</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ictus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 6, 778</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pericula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					14, 188</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Aus. Grat. Act. ad Grat.
			12</span></i>.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Act., not expecting, unsuspecting, careless</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ipsum accipiter necopinum rapit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Phaedr. 1, 9, 6</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">occultā necopinum (hostem) perde
					sagittā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 12, 596</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
